#: ../../commands.md:1
msgid "Commands"
msgstr ""
"命令"

#: ../../commands.md:3
msgid ""
"Type `/` commands at the prompt to inspect state, switch models, manage "
"the session, or configure runtime behavior on the fly. Run `/help` for "
"the built-in reference."
msgstr ""
"在 prompt 中输入 `/` 命令，可以查看状态、切换模型、管理 session 或即时修改 runtime 行为。运行 `/help` "
"查看内置参考。"

#: ../../commands.md:7
msgid "Looking around"
msgstr "查看状态"

#: ../../commands.md:9
msgid ""
"**`/status`** — Shows everything about the runtime at a glance: workspace"
" path, session id, active provider and model, calculated compaction-"
"budget fill percentage, conversation history, prompt-cache hit ratio, "
"code index state, background jobs, and whether an update is available."
msgstr ""
"**`/status`** — 一览 runtime 全貌：工作目录、session id、当前 provider 和模型、计算出的 "
"compaction 预算占用百分比、对话历史、prompt-cache 命中率、代码索引状态、后台任务以及是否有可用更新。"

#: ../../commands.md:14
msgid ""
"The /status command showing workspace, session, provider, context, and "
"code index state"
msgstr "`/status` 显示工作目录、session、provider、context 和代码索引状态"

#: ../../commands.md:19
msgid "The /status output at a glance."
msgstr "`/status` 输出概览。"

#: ../../commands.md:22
msgid ""
"**`/diff`** — Review changes from the latest turn or the whole session. "
"See [Reviewing changes](usage.md#reviewing-changes)."
msgstr "**`/diff`** — 审查最近一轮或整个 session 的修改。见[审查修改](usage.md#reviewing-changes)。"

#: ../../commands.md:27
msgid ""
"The two tabs pick the range; each row is one changed file with its added "
"and removed line counts. `Enter` opens the selected file's diff."
msgstr "两个 tab 用于选择范围；每行代表一个已修改文件，并显示新增和删除行数。按 `Enter` 打开所选文件的 diff。"

#: ../../commands.md:30
msgid ""
"**`/ps`** — Lists active background jobs (see [Tools](tools.md#built-in-"
"tools)). Each row shows job id, state, command, and elapsed time."
msgstr ""
"**`/ps`** — 列出活动的后台任务（见[工具](tools.md#built-in-tools)）。每行显示任务 "
"id、状态、命令和运行时间。"

#: ../../commands.md:33
msgid ""
"**`/skills`** — Lists every installed [skill](skills.md) by name, source,"
" and description."
msgstr "**`/skills`** — 按名称、来源和描述列出所有已安装 [skill](skills.md)。"

#: ../../commands.md:36
msgid ""
"**`/config`** — Shows the active configuration: provider blocks, runtime "
"settings, and their resolved values."
msgstr "**`/config`** — 显示当前配置：provider block、runtime 设置及其解析后的值。"

#: ../../commands.md:39
msgid "The code index"
msgstr "代码索引"

#: ../../commands.md:41
msgid ""
"**`/index [force]`** — Build or rebuild the code symbol index that powers"
" `InspectCode`. The first build walks every source file; later syncs are "
"fast. Add `force` to rebuild from scratch. See [Code symbol "
"index](tools.md#code-symbol-index) for details."
msgstr ""
"**`/index [force]`** — 构建或重建 `InspectCode` "
"使用的代码符号索引。首次构建扫描所有源文件，后续同步很快。加上 `force` 可从头重建。详见[代码符号索引](tools.md#code-"
"symbol-index)。"

#: ../../commands.md:46
msgid "Switching models"
msgstr "切换模型"

#: ../../commands.md:48
msgid ""
"Each takes an optional value: given one it switches straight away, given "
"none it opens a picker. `/provider` and `/model` chain onward, so picking"
" a provider walks you through the model, its protocol, and the effort."
msgstr ""
"每个命令都接受一个可选的值：给出值就直接切换，不给则打开选择器。`/provider` 与 `/model` 会继续往下走，因此选好 provider 后会依次带你选择模型、协议与推理强度。"

