"用于访问模型的协议"

#: ../../commands.md:14
msgid "`auto`, `chat`, `responses`, `anthropic`"
msgstr ""
"`auto`、`chat`、`responses`、`anthropic`"

#: ../../commands.md:59
msgid ""
"Effort is mapped to the nearest level a known model family accepts; "
"unrecognized models keep what you picked. A model that `/model` offered "
"can still come back unsupported, because one endpoint often serves "
"several families over different protocols — set the right one with "
"`/api`, or `auto` to re-infer it. Switching mid-session is safe either "
"way, since the history is protocol-neutral."
msgstr ""
"推理强度会被映射到已知模型系列所接受的最接近的档位；无法识别的模型则保留你选择的"
"值。`/model` 提供的模型仍可能返回不支持，因为同一个端点常常用不同协议服务多个模型系"
"列——用 `/api` 指定正确的协议，或用 `auto` 让它重新推断。无论哪种方式，会话中途切换都"
"是安全的，因为历史与协议无关。"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Switching providers and models interactively during a session"
msgstr "在 session 中交互式切换 provider 和模型"

#: ../../commands.md:69
msgid "Switching providers and models mid-session."
msgstr "在 session 中切换 provider 和模型。"

#: ../../commands.md:72
msgid "Managing the session"
msgstr "管理 session"

#: ../../commands.md:74
msgid ""
"**`/name [TEXT]`** — Show or set this session's name. See "
"[Names](usage.md#names)."
msgstr "**`/name [TEXT]`** — 查看或设置当前 session 的名称。参见[名称](usage.md#names)。"

#: ../../commands.md:76
msgid ""
"**`/sessions [all]`** — Browse saved sessions and re-enter one; `/resume`"
" is the same command. See [Switching sessions](usage.md#switching-"
"sessions)."
msgstr ""
"**`/sessions [all]`** — 浏览已保存的 session 并进入其中一个；`/resume` 是同一条命令。参见[切换 "
"session](usage.md#switching-sessions)。"

#: ../../commands.md:79
msgid ""
"**`/compact`** — Summarize and shrink the conversation immediately. "
"minacode keeps long sessions within budget on its own, but `/compact` "
"trims on demand."
msgstr "**`/compact`** — 立即总结并缩短对话。minacode 会自动控制长 session 的预算；`/compact` 用于按需压缩。"

#: ../../commands.md:82
msgid ""
"**`/compact log [seg.N]`** — Review what compaction kept: the stored "
"segments newest first, and the summary of the one you open. Naming a "
"segment prints its summary without the viewer. See [Keeping context "
"manageable](context.md#keeping-context-manageable)."
msgstr ""
"**`/compact log [seg.N]`** — "
"回顾压缩保留了什么：按时间倒序列出已存储的片段，并显示打开的那个片段的摘要；指定片段则不经查看器直接打印其摘要。参见[让上下文保持可控](context.md"
"#keeping-context-manageable)。"

#: ../../commands.md:87
msgid ""
"**`/worker [SUBCOMMAND]`** — Inspect or control the worker session. Tab "
"completion offers the subcommands and their values; see [Worker "
"delegation](worker.md#worker-delegation) for what a worker is."
msgstr ""
"**`/worker [SUBCOMMAND]`** —— 查看或控制 worker 会话。Tab 补全会给出子命令及其取值；worker "
"是什么见 [Worker 委派](worker.md#worker-delegation)。"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Subcommand"
msgstr "子命令"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`status` (default)"
msgstr "`status`（默认）"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid ""
"provider/model, reasoning, state, rounds, and context percent — or "
"`worker: no active session` with the configured `[worker] provider`"
msgstr ""
"provider/模型、推理强度、状态、轮数与上下文百分比——没有 worker 时则是 `worker: no active session` "
"以及配置里的 `[worker] provider`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`on` · `off`"
msgstr "`on` · `off`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Toggle the `runtime.worker` setting"
msgstr "切换 `runtime.worker` 设置"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`reset`"
msgstr "`reset`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Clear the worker's context; file changes and merged diffs survive"
msgstr "清空 worker 的上下文；文件改动与已合并的 diff 会保留"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`provider`"
msgstr "`provider`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid ""
"Pick an entry, then flow on into the model and reasoning pickers, "
"mirroring `/provider`'s chain; backing out of a stage keeps the earlier "
"ones"
msgstr "先选一个条目，然后继续进入模型与推理强度选择器，与 `/provider` 的链路一致；在任一步退出会保留前面已经设置好的阶段"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`provider NAME` · `provider off`"
msgstr "`provider NAME` · `provider off`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Re-target or clear the entry immediately, without the picker chain"
msgstr "不经选择器链路，立即重新指定或清除该条目"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`model` · `reason` · `api`"
msgstr "`model` · `reason` · `api`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid ""
"Pick from that entry's models, reasoning efforts, and wire protocols "
"(`auto`, `chat`, `responses`, `anthropic`); `default` restores "
"inheritance"
msgstr ""
"从该条目的模型、推理强度与 wire "
"protocol（`auto`、`chat`、`responses`、`anthropic`）中选择；`default` 恢复继承"

#: ../../commands.md:100
msgid ""
"Changes apply to a live worker and to later spawns alike. The `Delegate` "
"tool block itself is fixed when the session starts, so a worker turned on"
" mid-session takes effect next time."
msgstr ""
"改动对当前的 worker 和之后生成的 worker 同样生效。`Delegate` 工具块本身在会话启动时就固定了，因此会话中途打开 "
"worker 要到下一次会话才生效。"

#: ../../commands.md:103
msgid ""
"Every `Delegate send` asks for approval, even under `yolo` — the order is"
" a spec the model wrote for itself, so the brief is the one cheap check "
"on it. A refusal carries your reason back to the model."
msgstr ""
"每一次 `Delegate send` 都会请求批准，即使在 `yolo` 下也一样——order "
"是模型给自己写的规格，因此这份简报是对它唯一的低成本检查。拒绝时你的理由会回传给模型。"

#: ../../commands.md:107
msgid ""
"**`/language [NAME]`** — Show or force the session's reply language. "
"`auto`, the default, follows the language you write in; a name like "
"`Chinese` fixes it. The setting lives in the session rather than the "
"config file, and workers inherit it."
msgstr ""
"**`/language [NAME]`** —— 显示或强制本次会话的回复语言。默认的 `auto` 跟随你书写的语言；给出 `Chinese`"
" 这样的名字则固定下来。这个设置存在会话里而不是配置文件里，worker 会继承它。"

#: ../../commands.md:111
msgid "Settings and toggles"
msgstr "设置与开关"

#: ../../commands.md:113
msgid ""
"**`/set KEY VALUE`** — Set `provider.*` or `runtime.*` for the session; "
"tab-completes both keys and, where the values are a fixed set, the "
"values. Example: `/set provider.response_timeout 900`."
msgstr ""
"**`/set KEY VALUE`** — 为当前 session 设置 `provider.*` 或 `runtime.*`；key "
"以及有固定选项的 value 均支持 Tab 补全。例如：`/set provider.response_timeout 900`。"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`/yolo`"
msgstr "`/yolo`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid ""
"Toggle confirmation prompts — read [Safety](safety.md) before leaving "
"them off"
msgstr "切换操作确认——在长期关闭之前请阅读[安全](safety.md)"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`/hints`"
msgstr "`/hints`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid ""
"Toggle the model's next-step chips at the idle prompt (the `NextHints` "
"tool)"
msgstr "切换 idle 提示符处模型给出的下一步 chip（`NextHints` 工具）"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`/strict`"
msgstr "`/strict`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Toggle strict tool-call schemas (OpenAI / DeepSeek)"
msgstr "切换严格 tool-call schema（OpenAI / DeepSeek）"

#: ../../commands.md:122
msgid "While a turn runs"
msgstr "回合进行中"

#: ../../commands.md:124
msgid ""
"**`/resend`** — Cancel and re-send the model request in flight, without "
"restarting the turn. Use it when a response stalls. It only applies while"
" a request is waiting, not while the agent runs a tool. The divider "
"reports the retry and returns to `working`; automatic retries look the "
"same, with their attempt and reason, such as `retrying 2/6 · timeout`:"
msgstr ""
"**`/resend`** —— 取消并重发正在进行的模型请求，而不重启这个回合。响应卡住时用它。它只在请求等待中有效，agent "
"正在跑工具时无效。分隔线会显示这次重试，然后回到 `working`；自动重试看起来一样，并带上尝试次数和原因，例如 `retrying 2/6 "
"· timeout`："

#: ../../commands.md:131
msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

#: ../../commands.md:133
msgid "**`/mcp`** — Manage [MCP](mcp.md) server connections. Sub-commands:"
msgstr "**`/mcp`** — 管理 [MCP](mcp.md) server 连接。子命令如下："

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`/mcp`"
msgstr "`/mcp`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "List servers and connection status"
msgstr "列出 server 及连接状态"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`/mcp connect <server> [server ...]`"
msgstr "`/mcp connect <server> [server ...]`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Connect servers now"
msgstr "立即连接 server"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`/mcp disconnect <server>`"
msgstr "`/mcp disconnect <server>`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "Disconnect a server"
msgstr "断开一个 server"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "`/mcp tools [server]`"
msgstr "`/mcp tools [server]`"

#: ../../commands.md:64
msgid "List tools from a connected server"
msgstr "列出已连接 server 的工具"

#: ../../commands.md:142
msgid "Help and exit"
msgstr "帮助与退出"

#: ../../commands.md:144
msgid "**`/help`** — Show the built-in command and tool reference."
msgstr "**`/help`** — 显示内置命令和工具参考。"

#: ../../commands.md:146
msgid ""
"**`/exit`, `/quit`** — Leave minacode. Your session is saved "
"automatically and can be resumed with `-c` or `--resume`."
msgstr "**`/exit`, `/quit`** — 退出 minacode。Session 会自动保存，可使用 `-c` 或 `--resume` 恢复。"

